WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.500
Today we are playing a ping pong card game

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.580
Each suit represents a different shot

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.560
And the number decides the amount

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.840
First one to 4 points wins

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.780
Okay Emil

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.280
Pick a card

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.260
Let's see

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.400
9 edge shots for the edge guy

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.720
Almost missed the first one already

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.720
That seems to be easy

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.520
You would think the high ones are easy but no

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.220
I can't tell are you the edge guy or the ball breaker guy?

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.980
Probably both guys in one point!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.500
Okay Otto

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.160
What are you hoping for?

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.860
Around the nets of course

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.140
Why am I even asking you?

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.160
Let's see

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.260
Jack!

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.680
I'm pretty sure you won't get this one!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.360
I have a feeling you are going to make me move now

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.580
So far so good

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:21.140
5

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:22.860
6

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:23.820
Good!

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:25.580
7

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:27.240
8

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:29.300
9

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.160
10

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.580
The last one!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.060
Too bad Otto!

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:39.000
Really gentleman play Emil, nice!

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.180
Well done

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:44.520
It was actually nice to see you moving there around quite fast also

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.500
I have been practicing my footwork

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.780
Going to the fridge

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.980
Around the nets - where are they?

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.540
There they are!

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:55.580
1

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:57.420
2

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.200
There we have it!

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.800
I'll take one from there

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.400
3 edge shots

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.100
I'm going to put him some difficult places

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.260
1 more!

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:13.820
Nice one!

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.460
Thanks

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.300
Joker!

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.260
You get to choose!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.720
I get to choose the shot

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.220
And the amount of shots

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:26.080
Chops!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.160
1 chop

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.660
Jack of hearts

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.600
Now I'm so happy!

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.140
That was a bad ball

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:58.500
What were you saying?

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.620
We are over the half way

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:00.720
How is it feeling?

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:01.760
Good so far

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:02.320
Good!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.820
But still can't get too comfortable

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.080
Gotta stay focused, 2 more!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.080
That was close! It counts.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.340
That was almost a miss

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.800
That's it, 11!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.280
Good one, Otto!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:18.900
Thank you!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:22.740
13!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.500
13 behind the backs Emil

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.280
Okay this is not gonna go

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:35.120
I already knew from the second shot

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.180
Wasn't promising

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.140
1 or 14? You get to choose Otto.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.020
But if you choose just one

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.840
It has to be an around the net

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.260
So it has to be an around the net

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:45.960
Okay

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.720
He has it

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:54.920
You get the around the net

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.300
4 around the nets

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.980
Shouldn't be that big of a problem

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.060
On the GoPro

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.040
GoPro and the camera!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.000
1 more!

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.320
Yes, we have it

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:11.700
There we have it!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:13.460
I need to find the around the net

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.220
I'll use my laser vision

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.320
Okay, scroll back!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.920
What did Otto say?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:21.780
Let's go back!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.860
Chops!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.660
Otto what would have you chosen?

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.400
360 degree spin

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.220
No-look

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.040
Eyes closed

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:30.840
Behind the back

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.380
Between the legs

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.040
Wrong handed

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:32.740
Penhold

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.980
Around the net from under the table

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.440
I regret saying anything!

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.920
I have a strong feeling that he is not going to make this shot!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.340
I'm quite interested to see how this looks

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:50.000
Did it go in?

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.000
Yea, I heard something!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.320
Yea, I think that was perfect!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.880
Okay, between the legs

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.140
6 of those

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:06.640
Nice

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.180
Doing some good footwork here

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.000
Got them!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:14.620
1 more?

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.200
No! That was 6 for sure

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.400
I'll go with that one

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.640
10 between the legs!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.300
It feels like I need to move again

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.620
Let's start it easy and then make him move a bit more

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.700
Let's still put some easy ones, good!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.960
And now let's do the hard ones

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.000
There it was!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.860
I think that doesn't count anymore!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.060
Yea, I knew it was going to be like that

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.980
There is no gentleman rule anymore

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.040
Well, this was a fun and interesting game

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.260
Something you guys can also try at home

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.940
Yea, and remember to subscribe here

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.000
And watch our previous episodes there!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.760
Until next time!

